Entonces la contraseña es "heyheyhey"

Luego se hace la query en la base de datos "flagdb"
===================================================
(para saber las bases de datos, se usa "show databases")

root@fac50de5d760:~# mysql -h 172.18.0.3 -u root -pheyheyhey -D flagdb -e "select * from flag;"
mysql: [Warning] Using a password on the command line interface can be insecure.
+----+-------------------------------------------------------+
| id | flag                                                  |
+----+-------------------------------------------------------+
|  1 | first part of the flag: l1tter4lly_4_c4ptur3_th3_fl4g |
+----+-------------------------------------------------------+

Finalmente si justas la pass con la flag te queda
=================================================
l1tter4lly_4_c4ptur3_th3_fl4g:heyheyhey

